  "bio": "I am the author of The International Lover and the founder of this platform. In 2010 I made a decision to search abroad. In 2015 I flew to North Africa alone, navigated the culture, the family, the language, and the legal process, and married. She was half my age. She was virtuous. She was traditional. She was everything the American culture said did not exist.\n\nI have practiced fasting discipline for over 30 years. I am a martial artist, a multi-instrumentalist, a published author, and a community builder. I founded Minnesota's first Hip-Hop B-Boy crew in 1982. I have instructed thousands in martial arts, diet, language, history, and culture.\n\nI built this platform so other men could do what I did \u2014 correctly, with knowledge, and with dignity. What you see is not a claim. It is a testimony.",
